            </note>
            <note corresp="#d365-f2" n="15" xml:id="d365-f2-content">
                <p>Supplementary protocol signed at Lausanne, July 5, 1932, Great Britain, Cmd.
                    4206, Misc. No. 12 (1932): <hi rendition="#italic">Protocols respecting
                        Suspension of Certain Inter-Governmental Debts supplementary to Protocols
                        and Declarations signed at London, August 11 and 13, 1931, and January 21,
                        1932</hi>, p. 15.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
